<p class="Title">
 Einstein Field Equations from the Einstein-Hilbert Action (xAct)
</p>



<p class="Text">
 S = &int; d&#8308;x &radic;(-g) [ R/(2&kappa;) + L_matter ],&nbsp;&nbsp;&kappa; = 8&pi;G (c = 1), signature (-,+,+,+), no cosmological constant. Requires the xAct package (xTensor). Run cells top to bottom with Shift+Enter in the same kernel session.
</p>



<p class="Text">
 Author: Ankit C Khunt
</p>



<p class="Section">
 0. Load package
</p>



<p class="Text">
 Optional: run this first for a fresh kernel (then evaluate the next cell).
</p>



<p class="CellLabel">
 In[1]:=
</p>



<p class="Input">
 <span class="InputFormInline">Quit[]</span>
</p>



<p class="CellLabel">
 In[1]:=
</p>



<p class="Input">
 <span class="InputFormInline">&lt;&lt; xAct`xTensor`<br />$PrePrint = ScreenDollarIndices;<br />$CVVerbose = False;</span>
</p>



<p class="Print">
 
